# Tracked by allowlist: everything is ignored, and what belongs in the
# repository is named below. Same shape as the link check — permitted things
# are listed, and anything not listed does not get in by being overlooked.

*

!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!CNAME
!Makefile
!README.md

!/data/
!/data/*.js

!/scripts/
!/scripts/*.mjs

!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/*.yml

!/.claude/
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/*/
!/.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md
